{
  "$known": {
    "scryfall-blb-checklist t0 \"R\" order": "One-letter grade codes can get the wrong order. For card rarity (C, U, R, M), the model puts M (mythic) below U and R. Full names, such as Mythic Rare, get the correct order.",
    "bkref-thunder-2025 t0 \"Ht\" expected quantitative": "Heights written as 6-7 (feet and inches) are not read as numbers. They have the same form as a range (20-25) or a win-loss record (12-4). The column gets ordered labels: the order is correct, but the steps between heights are not to scale.",
    "wiki-demographics-of-japan t0 \"±% p.a.\" polarity": "A close decision can change from one run to the next. The model's answers are not fully repeatable near a threshold. For a population growth rate, two runs gave \"higher is better\" 55% and less than 50%.",
    "wiki-earthquakes-2023 not shared: t0:Death toll + t1:Death toll": "A close decision can change from one run to the next. The model's answers are not fully repeatable near a threshold. Two runs of the same question about death tolls in two earthquake tables gave a shared scale once and separate scales once."
  },

